	measure 'Total Leave' = ```
			
			CALCULATE (
			    SUM ( FactLeaveBalance[Hourly Balance] ),
			    FILTER ( 
			        FactLeaveBalance,
			        FactLeaveBalance[leave_name] = "Annual Leave"
			        ||
			        FactLeaveBalance[leave_name] = "Long Service Leave"
			        ||
			        FactLeaveBalance[leave_name] = "Alternative Holidays"
			    )
			)
			
			```
		formatString: #,0.00
		displayFolder: Leave Balances
		lineageTag: a02d8b0f-6780-45b9-994b-5bc06b909761

